# 📂 Smart File Organizer

A Python automation project that organizes files inside a folder into proper categories and generates a summary report.

## 🚀 What it does
This script scans a folder and automatically moves files into:
- Images
- Documents
- Videos
- Audio
- Others

It also creates a report showing how many files were moved in each category.

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- Python 3
- os module
- shutil module
- datetime module

## ⚙️ Features
- Auto file sorting by extension
- Automatic folder creation
- Duplicate file handling (safe move)
- Summary report generation
- Simple command-line interface

## 📁 Output Structure

Selected Folder/
├── Images/
├── Documents/
├── Videos/
├── Audio/
├── Others/
└── report.txt


## 💻 Example Output

Moved: photo.jpg -> Images
Moved: resume.pdf -> Documents
Moved: song.mp3 -> Audio
Moved: clip.mp4 -> Videos


